2026-10-09 19:43:12.541 DEBUG icod.agent.runtime.loop: STEP 10: model responded ->\n  - text: Here's the complete Smartsheet schema, compiled from the official Smartsheet Python SDK source code:\n\n---\n\n## Complete Smartsheet Data Model (from official SDK)\n\n### Entity Hierarchy\n```\nHome (user's root)\n├── Workspace\n│   ├── Folder (nested, unlimited depth)\n│   │   ├── Folder\n│   │   ├── Sheet\n│   │   ├── Report\n│   │   ├── Sight (Dashboard)\n│   │   └── Template\n│   ├── Sheet\n│   ├── Report\n│   ├── Sight (Dashboard)\n│   └── Template\n├── Folder (top-level, also nestable)\n│   └── ...same as above\n├── Sheet\n├── Report\n├── Sight (Dashboard)\n└── Template\n```\n\n---\n\n### SHEET\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id` | Long | Unique 64-bit identifier |\n| `name` | String | Sheet name |\n| `access_level` | Enum(AccessLevel) | OWNER, ADMIN, EDIT, EDIT_SHARE, CREATE, COMMENT, VIEW |\n| `owner` | String | Email of the owner |\n| `owner_id` | Long | User ID of the owner |\n| `permalink` | String | URL to the sheet in Smartsheet |\n| `version` | Number | Increments on every change |\n| `total_row_count` | Number | Total number of rows |\n| `read_only` | Boolean | Whether sheet is read-only |\n| `favorite` | Boolean | Whether user has favorited it |\n| `gantt_enabled` | Boolean | Gantt chart mode enabled |\n| `dependencies_enabled` | Boolean | Predecessor dependencies enabled |\n| `resource_management_enabled` | Boolean | Resource management enabled |\n| `has_summary_fields` | Boolean | Summary tab has data |\n| `show_parent_rows_for_filters` | Boolean | Parent row visibility in filters |\n| `from_id` | Long | ID of source (if created from template/sheet) |\n| `created_at` | Timestamp | Creation time |\n| `modified_at` | Timestamp | Last modification time |\n| `columns` | List\<Column\> | Ordered list of columns |\n| `rows` | List\<Row\> | Ordered list of rows |\n| `attachments` | List\<Attachment\> | Sheet-level attachments |\n| `discussions` | List\<Discussion\> | Sheet-level discussions |\n| `contact_references` | List\<ContactObjectValue\> | Contact list references |\n| `cross_sheet_references` | List\<CrossSheetReference\> | Cross-sheet formula links |\n| `filters` | List\<SheetFilter\> | Saved filters |\n| `summary` | SheetSummary | Sheet Summary (key-value metadata) |\n| `project_settings` | ProjectSettings | Gantt/project settings |\n| `user_permissions` | SheetUserPermissions | Current user's permissions |\n| `user_settings` | SheetUserSettings | User-specific sheet settings |\n| `workspace` | Workspace | Parent workspace (if applicable) |\n| `source` | Source | Source template/sheet info |\n| `effective_attachment_options` | List\<Enum\> | Allowed attachment types |\n\n---\n\n### COLUMN\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id` | Long | Unique 64-bit identifier |\n| `title` | String | Column name/heading |\n| `index` | Number | 0-based position in sheet |\n| `type` | Enum(ColumnType) | Column type (see below) |\n| `primary` | Boolean | First column only; always TEXT_NUMBER |\n| `width` | Number | Width in pixels |\n| `hidden` | Boolean | Hidden from view |\n| `locked` | Boolean | Locked (read-only for non-admins) |\n| `locked_for_user` | Boolean | Locked for current user (computed) |\n| `validation` | Boolean | Enforce validation rules |\n| `options` | List\<String\> | Dropdown values (for PICKLIST) |\n| `symbol` | Enum(Symbol) | Icon set (star, flag, etc.) |\n| `system_column_type` | Enum(SystemColumnType) | Auto-number, modified date, etc. |\n| `auto_number_format` | AutoNumberFormat | Auto-number prefix/suffix settings |\n| `contact_options` | List\<Contact\> | Allowed contacts (for CONTACT_LIST) |\n| `description` | String | Column description/tooltip |\n| `formula` | String | Column-level formula |\n| `format` | String | Formatting string |\n| `tags` | List\<String\> | Tags (e.g., `["CALENDAR"]`) |\n| `version` | Number | Column definition version |\n\n**ColumnType enum values:**\n`TEXT_NUMBER`, `DATE`, `DATETIME`, `CHECKBOX`, `PICKLIST`, `CONTACT_LIST`, `DURATION`, `PREDECESSOR`, `ABSTRACT_DATETIME`\n\n**SystemColumnType enum values:**\n`AUTO_NUMBER`, `... (+10853 chars)
